{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "15e3a53487242ca512229e591053055770fd2444f58ec51922bec9c4292dda0c", "ja": "ピンチ！　大きなケーキと茜ちゃん！", "zh": "危机！巨大的蛋糕和小茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "85dc8547137bd02bc0529233b311cf97806721b52a60e84acff4b3638f415e9c", "ja": "他のチームが気になる茜は、杏奈たちの\nチームが巨大なケーキを作っているのを\n目撃し、ネタ被りに焦りはじめる。だが\n偵察しているところを紗代子と杏奈に\n見つかり、正論パンチにダメージをくらう。", "zh": "担心其他队伍的茜目睹了杏奈她们的队伍正在制作巨型蛋糕，开始因创意撞车而焦急起来。然而，她在侦察时被紗代子和杏奈发现，还被正论一击打得受到了伤害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "606beb988c2b158d74694cabe67943d12e8ee217ad315973c4f7db5ee6d34cf8", "ja": "ところで、杏奈ちゃんチームは……\nええっ！？　なに、あの巨大なスポンジケーキは！", "zh": "话说回来，杏奈小队是……\n诶！？那块巨大的海绵蛋糕是什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "a6572fa10eb2bbc1246fc4103228a6f39101dec49aa176782d3a7d7bb5f86ef8", "ja": "え、『巨大茜ちゃんチョコ』と方向性被ってない？\nハッ、だから中ボスって言ってたの！？", "zh": "诶，和“巨大小茜巧克力”的方向不是撞上了吗？\n哈，所以你才说是中BOSS的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "e765fb91d3d581b2374b2506e6704f3c30617f9713d0d5a684cbf5b916d35a11", "ja": "もう、茜ちゃん？\nこんなところでこそこそして、また偵察してたの？", "zh": "真是的，小茜？\n在这种地方鬼鬼祟祟的，又在侦察了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "ca2702957d1e2bab838edb157cf262b5e25c7dae3b9bdd477466c68e614599ac", "ja": "偵察なんてするより、\n自分の仕事をがんばったほうが建設的だよ！", "zh": "与其进行侦察，还是努力做好自己的工作更有建设性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "e9177c740328ee754c0b847e8a435e0f224fb9d410ae4064eb98f4cf20d3c013", "ja": "紗代子ちゃん！　さすがの茜ちゃんといえど、\n出会い頭の正論パンチにはなすすべもないよ！", "zh": "纱代子！就算是鼎鼎大名的小茜，面对迎面而来的正论一拳，也完全束手无策啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "c81a687b41a8d7454ce97024145b4e66f9c5b200bee99cceda7340898d226949", "ja": "？　もしかして茜さん、杏奈たちのチームと、\n作るものが被ってるかもって、気にしてるの？", "zh": "？难道茜小姐是在意，可能会和杏奈她们的团队做出一样的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "b1e16b5f468f9fa114ff903fa05a0b088f93a40972fabf9b940b55d6b22a4576", "ja": "ギクッ！　そ、そそそんなことないよ？　茜ちゃん\nチームには、優秀なメンバーが揃っているからね！", "zh": "呃！才、才不是那回事呢？小茜\n团队里可是有很多优秀成员呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "970aa4efe0980dfb561a8da5a7da02047b0b13543103e29dfb6944357ef34046", "ja": "それなら、茜さんは仲間を信じてあげて！\nお互いがんばって、最高にステキなチョコを作ろうね！", "zh": "那样的话，就请茜小姐相信伙伴们吧！  \n大家一起加油，做出最棒的巧克力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_04_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "5f018d91c25a27b47d551d68b1f2c6f6d114fd89356b210a926dec65b1632a99", "ja": "ぐふっ！　いいこと言ってる！\n茜ちゃん、正論パンチに殴られるのは本日2回目です！", "zh": "呜噗！说得好有道理！  \n被小茜的正论拳打中，今天已经是第2次了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
